          "label": "Use i <= (letters.length - 1)"
        },
        {
          "id": "no-way",
          "label": "It's impossible to use <= with arrays"
        }
      ],
      "allowText": true,
      "hint": "Think about what the last valid index actually is."
    }
  ],
